<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Smith Barney cuts Lucent.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Smith Barney cuts Lucent.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Tony Langham said he cut his rating on Lucent Technologies Inc to neutral from outperform.     --</p>
<p>The analyst said he cut his price target on the stock to $62 from $67.</p>
<p>-- He declined to provide further details on the move.</p>
<p>((-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736))</p>
